cff-version: 1.3.0
message: "If you use this dataset or report, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "The state of public agent skills and MCP servers, October 2026"
abstract: >-
  A random sample of 2,999 public GitHub repositories that ship agent skills,
  plugin or marketplace manifests or MCP server manifests, scanned with
  open-source tools on 13 October 2026, with hand-checked precision for each
  measure. Dataset, method, scripts and charts. Version 1.1.0 adds a follow-up
  report on MCP tool annotations in the 399 sampled repositories that ship a
  server.json. Version 1.2.0 adds a follow-up report on whether the launch
  commands in those repositories' READMEs pin an exact version. Version 1.3.0
  adds a follow-up report on what 3,715 skills that grant unscoped Bash do
  with the shell.
authors:
